	"nodes":[
		{"id":"c4ceb9834e4a0aa7","type":"text","text":"找工作经历、工作内容","x":-231,"y":100,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3722d743cbe5799d","type":"text","text":"自学经历、换工作、新工作内容","x":-231,"y":-400,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"9c05490224cb5a98","type":"text","text":"自由职业、近年经历、对未来行业看法","x":120,"y":-140,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"5d8c5ac04f056a0d","type":"text","text":"# 职业经历","x":-196,"y":-140,"width":180,"height":60},
		{"id":"24358b2c9c3ecced","type":"text","text":"学历、文化背景、实习经历","x":-950,"y":-140,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"36b7090d072a372e","x":-1245,"y":130,"width":840,"height":420,"type":"text","text":"I only have a Vocational high school Diploma. In 2013, my school sent me to intern at a tire factory in Zhangjiagang, Jiangsu. but that job isn't suit me,  As thus, I found new job by online, and then I went to Shanghai alone. \nThat is a skill education company online. I work as teacher, and actually, the position is just a salesperson.\nI worked from 2016 to 2018 for two years. That's great time. I learned too much skills and extensive experience.\nFinally, Summer of 2018, I quitted my job and rented a house as a office. Yeah, I trained online with other two partners.\nMy partners were in charge recording course. For me, besides recording course, I also needed to do much work, such as managing website, reception learners.\nWe did a lot of work and were exhausted, **yet** we **didn't even make** much **money**. Though we were team, but we did things singly. Until the end of 2o19, in the end, we dissloved.\nFinally, I backed to my hometown. And next I attended my cousin's wedding. Then the coronavirus broke out. I didn't go out in 2020 due to the epidemic situation. I stayed in home as a freelancer. Until next year, I found a job in the local city as a photographer and video editor.\nI just worked there for less than a year, and quit."}
	],
